WEBVTT

00:00:33.617 --> 00:00:35.869
Oh, put down the binoculars, Fry.

00:00:35.953 --> 00:00:39.373
The wall of that strip club
isn't going to collapse twice in one day.

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:41.792
I know. And I've grown to accept that.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.003
Now I'm more interested in that
new pizza parlor across the street.

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:48.215
Kinda makes me pine for my days
as a pizza delivery boy.

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:51.301
"Here's your pizza!" I'd say.
"I didn't order any!" they'd say.

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:53.262
And then I'd be off to my next adventure.

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:56.223
That story stunk. Hand me the binoculars.

00:01:03.564 --> 00:01:05.816
I think the owner is from Signas-Five.

00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:07.943
Signoids? On our block?

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:11.321
Fi and foo! They should go back
where they came from!

00:01:11.405 --> 00:01:12.906
Professor, please!

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.325
Society's never gonna make any progress

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:17.703
until we all learn
to pretend to like each other.

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:21.123
Now, let's go over there and make
these hideous strangers feel welcome.

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:22.332
No!

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:24.960
You sure about these chairs?

00:01:25.169 --> 00:01:28.046
Guidebooks says human legs
bend down at knee.

00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:29.798
It's okay, Mama.

00:01:29.965 --> 00:01:33.927
Anyone-a complains,
I bend legs up for free!

00:01:34.469 --> 00:01:36.096
Ooh! Customers!

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.851
Welcome to Earth Pizza Store!

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:43.645
Here, sit! I bend the knees for you.

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:45.898
Ooh, that's comfy.

00:01:49.735 --> 00:01:53.280
Okay, now, what kind of pizza goes in you?

00:01:54.448 --> 00:01:57.784
Silt? Asbestos? We got guano, very fresh.

00:01:58.202 --> 00:02:00.829
Uh... Mmm. Do you have any food?

00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:05.459
Here, try a deep-a dish a-pizza.
Contains-a four kind-a things.

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:14.551
Ugh!

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.596
I don't mean to offend,
but this tastes like vomit.

00:02:17.763 --> 00:02:19.723
- Thank you!
- No, actually,

00:02:19.848 --> 00:02:22.434
I did mean to offend a little.
This is awful.

00:02:32.361 --> 00:02:35.280
Hey, hey, what's wrong?
Was it something Leela said?

00:02:36.073 --> 00:02:40.994
We come-a to Earth to start new life,
raise fat, spoiled Earth kids,

00:02:41.119 --> 00:02:44.206
hang many underwear
from Earth clothesline,

00:02:44.331 --> 00:02:46.041
live Earthican dream.

00:02:49.878 --> 00:02:53.173
Aw, don't cry, foreign people.
I used to work in a pizzeria.

00:02:53.298 --> 00:02:55.634
And as soon as I stop
hallucinating and blasting puke,

00:02:55.759 --> 00:02:58.220
I'm gonna teach you
to sell pizza, Earth-style.

00:02:58.387 --> 00:03:01.390
Oh, thank you, magic biped!

00:03:03.767 --> 00:03:05.769
You save us-a, sir.

00:03:05.894 --> 00:03:09.398
If we cannot-a make Earth Pizza
our dream will die.

00:03:09.523 --> 00:03:12.609
Just like rats we crushed
to make the wine.

00:03:20.117 --> 00:03:22.619
For starters,
only use quality ingredients.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:24.872
Case in point? No more live bees.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.500
Oregano works equally well.

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:31.044
And when you put pizzas in the oven,
don't get in with them.

00:03:31.503 --> 00:03:33.088
Hey! Ocupado!

00:03:34.089 --> 00:03:37.384
Most important of all,
is the big screen TV.

00:03:38.343 --> 00:03:40.387
Human families
need a TV while they're eating,

00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:42.222
so they don't have to talk to each other.

00:03:43.015 --> 00:03:45.017
Ah, the Earthican pastime.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:46.101
Blernsball!

00:03:48.812 --> 00:03:51.064
Mulligan drives the ball.

00:03:51.148 --> 00:03:53.984
It's going...going
and caught by the shortstop.

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:55.444
Mets lose again.

00:03:55.569 --> 00:03:59.656
Man, I haven't seen play this bad
since the days of Bob Uecker.

00:03:59.865 --> 00:04:02.534
This is Bob Uecker saying
thanks for watching.

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:06.830
Mets? Short-a-stoppa? Pinching the hitter?

00:04:06.955 --> 00:04:09.333
I don't understand this Blerns-a-ball.

00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:12.085
Well, if you're gonna be Earthicans,
we'll have to teach you.

00:04:12.211 --> 00:04:15.172
How about your pizzeria
plays a game against Planet Express?

00:04:15.339 --> 00:04:18.383
- Oh, but you'll need nine players.
- No problem.

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:26.225
Play the ball!

00:04:43.492 --> 00:04:46.662
Go, team! Beat those no-good Signoids!

00:04:46.995 --> 00:04:50.541
Show them they stink in a game
they've never played before!

00:04:54.586 --> 00:04:57.840
Ah, this is-a why I love Earth-a.

00:04:58.006 --> 00:05:03.345
Beautiful star-brightened day,
friendly Blernsball game with chum pals.

00:05:03.595 --> 00:05:05.305
So pleasant for everybody.

00:05:06.932 --> 00:05:07.933
Oh!

00:05:08.267 --> 00:05:10.102
Hit by a pitch. Take your base.

00:05:10.352 --> 00:05:15.232
Sorry about that! I guess
I needed a few more warm-up pitches.

00:05:19.027 --> 00:05:20.737
No batter! No batter!

00:05:22.614 --> 00:05:24.992
- No batter anymore.
- Take your base.

00:05:25.325 --> 00:05:29.371
I didn't mean to hit you!
I have some trouble with depth perception.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:32.124
Yeah. Me too, now.

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:37.254
Hey, batter, batter, batter, batter! Hey,
batter, batter, batter, batter...

00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:39.006
- Duck!
- Take your base.

00:05:42.134 --> 00:05:46.513
Please, lady! I want to live.
Can I use bat to protect head? Ow!

00:05:46.805 --> 00:05:48.098
Apparently not.

00:05:48.599 --> 00:05:52.019
Check out the one-eyed bean machine!

00:05:55.147 --> 00:05:57.649
Hooray! I make a score point!

00:05:58.775 --> 00:06:01.695
Leela, you beaned a run in.
You'd better let me pitch.

00:06:01.778 --> 00:06:03.655
But I've got a no-hitter going.

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:06.533
You're right. Here.

00:06:10.204 --> 00:06:13.123
Don't take her out! She's a firecracker!

00:06:14.249 --> 00:06:15.959
Excuse me. I'd like to talk to you.

00:06:16.293 --> 00:06:17.503
Am I under arrest?

00:06:17.669 --> 00:06:19.796
Wait! I know you!

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:23.008
You're the sleaze bag who owns
the Ultimate Robot Fighting League.

00:06:23.091 --> 00:06:26.720
Not anymore. Now, I'm the sleaze bag
who owns the New New York Mets!

00:06:26.803 --> 00:06:29.431
The Mets? Those bums are worse than me!

00:06:29.765 --> 00:06:32.518
Close to it.
But, they don't draw a crowd like you.

00:06:32.601 --> 00:06:34.728
Which is why I want
to sign ya to the team.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:36.438
Oh, you mean...

00:06:36.522 --> 00:06:40.442
I'd be the first woman ever
to play major league Blernsball?

00:06:40.609 --> 00:06:43.153
Well yeah, but basically,
it'd just be a publicity stunt.

00:06:43.403 --> 00:06:46.532
I figure a one-eyed lady skull-buster
might bring out the freak show crowd.

00:06:46.657 --> 00:06:51.119
Wow! The first woman ever
to play major league Blernsball!

00:06:51.203 --> 00:06:52.829
Again, yeah.
But basically, you'd just be...

00:06:52.913 --> 00:06:54.748
Yippee!

00:07:01.588 --> 00:07:06.051
Ta-dah! The first woman ever to play
major league Blernsball!

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:08.846
- How do I look?
- Like a sexy Yogi Berra.

00:07:08.971 --> 00:07:11.515
Uh, why is your number seven-eights?

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:13.559
All the whole numbers have been retired.

00:07:13.725 --> 00:07:17.104
Well, I must say I'm impressed.
You look just like a ball player.

00:07:17.646 --> 00:07:20.774
- Can I pat you on the butt?
- Fry, I'm a professional athlete.

00:07:20.899 --> 00:07:22.109
So, go ahead.

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:24.987
Oh, now I'm too nervous.

00:07:36.957 --> 00:07:38.792
Well, folks, it's only the fifth inning,

00:07:38.917 --> 00:07:41.044
but the Swedes have already
turned this one into a laffer.

00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:42.921
And that's with two "f's!"

00:07:43.005 --> 00:07:45.924
The crowd is pouring
out of the stadium L.A. style!

00:07:48.051 --> 00:07:51.889
Skipper, we're losing the crowd.
Put in our new novelty act, Leela.

00:07:53.515 --> 00:07:56.185
Nag daggit!
I already put in the circus clown!

00:07:56.268 --> 00:08:00.022
Yeah, but he bunted. Clowns are only funny
when they swing away!

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:03.525
Your attention, please.
Now pitching for the Mets...

00:08:03.859 --> 00:08:05.861
Turanga Leela!

00:08:07.696 --> 00:08:09.239
A one-eyed woman.

00:08:09.573 --> 00:08:10.657
- Hmm?
- What?

00:08:11.325 --> 00:08:14.369
Whoo-hoo! Come on! Throw like a girl!

00:08:14.453 --> 00:08:16.246
Go! Leela! Whoo-hoo! Yeah!

00:08:16.371 --> 00:08:18.081
Too much eyeliner!

00:08:19.082 --> 00:08:21.293
This is history in the making, folks!

00:08:21.418 --> 00:08:24.505
Bjornson steps up to the plate
and Leela delivers.

00:08:25.005 --> 00:08:26.381
Oh, gee!

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:27.883
Bull’s-eye!

00:08:28.008 --> 00:08:30.427
Ooh! An inauspicious start

00:08:30.511 --> 00:08:33.013
for the career
of the first woman Blernsballer!

00:08:35.933 --> 00:08:36.934
Oh!

00:08:37.017 --> 00:08:38.977
An inauspicious continuation

00:08:39.061 --> 00:08:41.271
for the career
of the first woman Blernsballer.

00:08:53.075 --> 00:08:56.828
Bean! Bean! Bean!

00:09:02.084 --> 00:09:03.085
Oh!

00:09:04.253 --> 00:09:06.755
Ouch! It's a three bean ball salad!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:09.341
The Mets fans love it, though.
And who can blame them?

00:09:09.424 --> 00:09:12.052
They haven't had
much to cheer about this year. Oh!

00:09:17.766 --> 00:09:19.393
Kid, that was great!

00:09:19.518 --> 00:09:22.896
You got us more publicity
than a cowboy in a shark tank!

00:09:23.188 --> 00:09:25.148
Poor Tex. He was quite a shark.

00:09:30.028 --> 00:09:32.281
Hey! Hey! Oh! Come on! Sorry.

00:09:32.489 --> 00:09:33.657
I win.

00:09:33.866 --> 00:09:35.075
Oop! Sorry.

00:09:37.536 --> 00:09:38.996
Bender, how did you get in here?

00:09:39.162 --> 00:09:42.291
As your agent,
I have access to you at all times.

00:09:42.416 --> 00:09:43.876
Since when are you my agent?

00:09:44.293 --> 00:09:47.337
Quiet! Call comin' in. Yes?

00:09:48.088 --> 00:09:50.507
A big endorsement deal
for Leela? How much?

00:09:50.924 --> 00:09:55.053
Hey! You put a one and two zeros
in front of that, or we pass!

00:09:55.345 --> 00:09:56.346
Deal!

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:59.099
Bender, that's great!
How much did you get me?

00:09:59.308 --> 00:10:01.059
One hundred dollars!

00:10:04.479 --> 00:10:08.400
As a pitcher,
I serve up plenty of bean balls.

00:10:08.692 --> 00:10:11.778
So, I know good beans when I see them.

00:10:11.987 --> 00:10:15.073
Bean-Bay Beans! They're the beaniest!

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:17.701
Cut!

00:10:18.744 --> 00:10:21.288
Bean! Bean! Bean!

00:10:21.872 --> 00:10:25.167
In very short order,
Leela has become a fan favorite.

00:10:37.971 --> 00:10:39.473
You're the best, babe!

00:10:39.556 --> 00:10:41.808
Hang on. Call comin' in. What's that?

00:10:42.059 --> 00:10:45.020
Hey, you put a one and two zeroes
n front of that, or we pass!

00:10:45.521 --> 00:10:47.689
- Deal!
- So, what did you get me?

00:10:47.814 --> 00:10:50.108
A thousand and one pesos.

00:11:03.497 --> 00:11:06.959
Cut! Okay.
Now do one with the bean suit on.

00:11:13.006 --> 00:11:15.425
Leela really bringin' in the customers.

00:11:15.551 --> 00:11:18.846
This keep up,
we need to buy second sauce toilet!

00:11:19.054 --> 00:11:20.973
When I grow up, I want to injure men

00:11:21.056 --> 00:11:23.725
by throwing stuff at them,
just like you, Leela.

00:11:23.809 --> 00:11:25.185
Will you sign my magazine?

00:11:25.978 --> 00:11:29.106
Aw, sure thing, sweetie.
Who should I make it out to?

00:11:29.314 --> 00:11:30.482
Well, uh...

00:11:31.066 --> 00:11:33.902
- to e-Bay?
- That's a popular name today.

00:11:34.111 --> 00:11:35.612
Little "E," big "B"?

00:11:39.992 --> 00:11:40.993
Heh, heh.

00:11:41.159 --> 00:11:43.579
Five bucks an autograph, 200 fans,

00:11:43.829 --> 00:11:47.082
add a one and two zeroes in front of that,
we got ourselves a wad!

00:11:47.416 --> 00:11:49.001
I'm not doing this for the "wad!"

00:11:49.168 --> 00:11:52.504
I'm doing it for all the struggling
female athletes who need a role model.

00:11:52.713 --> 00:11:54.798
Yeah, a role model for how to stink.

00:11:54.882 --> 00:11:56.341
- Wow!
- What?

00:11:56.675 --> 00:11:58.594
- Who are you?
- Jackie Anderson.

00:11:58.844 --> 00:12:01.346
I'm on the Blernsball team at NNYU.

00:12:01.471 --> 00:12:03.807
And I was hoping to get to play
in the majors soon.

00:12:03.932 --> 00:12:05.976
Oh, following in my footsteps.

00:12:06.185 --> 00:12:07.769
God forbid!

00:12:07.978 --> 00:12:10.147
Your little freak show
is makin' it impossible

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:12.900
for real female ballplayers
to be taken seriously.

00:12:13.567 --> 00:12:15.360
I hope you're proud of yourself.

00:12:25.537 --> 00:12:29.041
All right, show's over, no refunds.
You heard the robot. Get out!

00:12:32.628 --> 00:12:33.629
I'm a fool.

00:12:33.879 --> 00:12:37.341
The fans haven't been cheering "for" me.
They've been cheering "at" me.

00:12:37.591 --> 00:12:39.218
Don't be upset, Leela.

00:12:39.301 --> 00:12:42.804
You, uh... Well, you look
really cute in your uniform.

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:45.265
That's what makes it so sad!

00:12:45.724 --> 00:12:48.060
I thought I was doing something heroic!

00:12:48.268 --> 00:12:51.271
You are! What about that little girl
you visited in the hospital!

00:12:51.396 --> 00:12:53.524
You know the one I mean. The one who died?

00:12:53.732 --> 00:12:55.108
You're right.

00:12:55.442 --> 00:12:57.236
I can't let people down anymore.

00:12:57.694 --> 00:12:59.112
As God is my witness,

00:12:59.279 --> 00:13:02.699
I vow to earn the respect
of girls and women everywhere!

00:13:03.033 --> 00:13:07.162
I will become
the best Blernsball player of all time!

00:13:07.287 --> 00:13:10.165
That's statistically impossible.

00:13:10.374 --> 00:13:13.252
In 77 innings,
you haven't gotten a single out.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:17.422
At this rate, you're sure to go down as
the worst Blernsball player of all time.

00:13:17.631 --> 00:13:20.092
Oh. Then I have a new vow.

00:13:20.342 --> 00:13:21.927
I solemnly swear,

00:13:22.052 --> 00:13:26.223
I will become "Not the worst
Blernsball player of all time!"

00:13:27.891 --> 00:13:28.892
Oh!

00:13:45.951 --> 00:13:49.288
Hey, look! The players who broke
the various color barriers!

00:13:50.414 --> 00:13:55.460
When will man learn that all races
are equally inferior to robots?

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:59.715
Ah, here we are.
The worst player in history.

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:01.675
If I could be just
a little better than him,

00:14:01.758 --> 00:14:03.802
I can slink away with my head held high.

00:14:04.011 --> 00:14:08.015
It says he once struck out when his tongue
got stuck to an unusually cold bat.

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:10.434
And here he is trying to make a catch
with an oven mitt!

00:14:10.642 --> 00:14:12.644
It's even a crummy hologram.

00:14:12.895 --> 00:14:16.523
I'm not a hologram. Though I am crummy.
Hank Aaron the 24th

00:14:16.773 --> 00:14:19.735
Hank Aaron the 24th?
How could you play so blow-fully?

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:21.445
The original Hank Aaron was great!

00:14:21.653 --> 00:14:25.616
No, I was better than great.
I was the home-run king.

00:14:25.824 --> 00:14:27.034
Neat!

00:14:27.618 --> 00:14:31.121
So, Hank? The bad Hank?
Just how blowful were you?

00:14:31.288 --> 00:14:34.041
- Well, I had a low battin' average.
- Low?

00:14:34.166 --> 00:14:38.295
It was zero, you fungo! You went
your whole career without getting a hit.

00:14:38.629 --> 00:14:39.922
Leela can beat that.

00:14:40.005 --> 00:14:42.132
She's pitched her whole career
without getting an out!

00:14:42.257 --> 00:14:44.510
You stink, lady!

00:14:44.718 --> 00:14:47.596
Hey, Junior?
She belongs in the exhibit instead of you!

00:14:47.679 --> 00:14:50.724
Forget it.
This job's too cushy to give up.

00:14:51.975 --> 00:14:55.687
Ah, Wade Boggs, goes down smooth.

00:14:55.854 --> 00:14:59.483
Look, I don't want to be in this exhibit.
That's why I need your help,

00:14:59.775 --> 00:15:02.778
so I can be one tiny iota
less pathetic than you.

00:15:02.945 --> 00:15:05.405
Oh, I can't help you play
better than Tiny Iota.

00:15:05.531 --> 00:15:09.409
That guy was great!
But, I'll teach you everything I know.

00:15:11.954 --> 00:15:13.705
Okay, let's see what you can do.

00:15:13.789 --> 00:15:17.376
One thing she can do is lodge a ball
in the dead center of your brain.

00:15:17.459 --> 00:15:18.710
You'd better get a batting helmet.

00:15:22.548 --> 00:15:24.466
All right. Low and away.

00:15:25.801 --> 00:15:27.803
Oh!

00:15:31.098 --> 00:15:32.099
Ah...

00:15:32.975 --> 00:15:34.560
Okay. Try it again.

00:15:34.726 --> 00:15:37.437
But this time,
keep your eye "off the ball."

00:15:37.521 --> 00:15:39.356
You mean keep your eye "on the ball"?

00:15:39.648 --> 00:15:41.900
Hey, lady?
Which one of us is in the Hall of Fame?

00:15:42.317 --> 00:15:43.986
Psst! You're holding the bat upside down.

00:15:44.653 --> 00:15:45.821
Just pitch the ball.

00:15:46.488 --> 00:15:48.782
Okay. Eye off the ball.

00:15:52.411 --> 00:15:55.205
- Strike!
- Yeah, you did it, Leela!

00:15:55.414 --> 00:15:57.541
Oh! I didn't hit the batter!

00:15:57.791 --> 00:16:00.627
For once I was pitching
and not just belly itching!

00:16:00.752 --> 00:16:03.922
Oh, you got that, too?
I think there's a rash goin' around.

00:16:12.431 --> 00:16:15.517
Welcome to Fenway Park,
home of the Boston Poindexters,

00:16:15.601 --> 00:16:18.145
where the Mets close out
a season that will rank among

00:16:18.228 --> 00:16:20.355
mankind's most awful crimes.

00:16:22.858 --> 00:16:24.860
Hey, you opened a franchise!

00:16:24.985 --> 00:16:28.947
Yes! Our biggest seller
is Leela's Bean Pizza!

00:16:29.198 --> 00:16:32.701
Six kinds of beans,
plus several things that look like beans.

00:16:33.035 --> 00:16:34.328
Beans, huh?

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:38.665
Mmm, this is great!
How do you make the crust so fizzy?

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:41.793
Uh, uh, uh. Ancient Signoid secret.

00:16:42.085 --> 00:16:46.548
My husband. Some hotshot.
Here's his ancient Signoid secret.

00:16:47.549 --> 00:16:51.011
Live hornets.
We smoosh them right into dough.

00:16:51.178 --> 00:16:53.722
Look, I don't care
if there's horse manure in it.

00:16:53.847 --> 00:16:56.308
- That's-a good.
- I want to buy this franchise.

00:16:56.517 --> 00:16:58.519
How does a $100,000 sound?

00:16:58.727 --> 00:17:02.397
Forget it-a! We come to Earth
to make-a pizza, not-a money!

00:17:02.523 --> 00:17:04.566
No, Blek! Other way around.

00:17:04.733 --> 00:17:06.401
Oh, right. Offer accepted.

00:17:10.072 --> 00:17:14.326
Well, fans, Boston's turning the last game
of the season into a real squeaker.

00:17:14.451 --> 00:17:16.495
And that's with three "E's!"

00:17:16.662 --> 00:17:19.373
Two men on,
and they're down to their last out.

00:17:20.791 --> 00:17:24.878
Come on, Skipper. It's my last chance
to prove I'm not the worst player ever.

00:17:25.045 --> 00:17:26.922
- Please put me in.
- No.

00:17:27.047 --> 00:17:28.674
We're actually winning this game!

00:17:28.841 --> 00:17:31.301
You only go in as a joke
when we're eight runs behind,

00:17:31.468 --> 00:17:34.429
or when our other pitchers
sneak out early to beat the traffic!

00:17:35.055 --> 00:17:38.016
Come on!
Let's see some fundamentals out there!

00:17:39.226 --> 00:17:41.436
And not clown fundamentals!

00:17:47.776 --> 00:17:53.282
Ah! Darn! Darn! Darn!
Now the bases are loaded!

00:17:53.407 --> 00:17:56.743
Isn't there a man on this team
who can get one more out?

00:17:56.952 --> 00:17:58.745
- I can!
- I repeat.

00:17:58.954 --> 00:18:02.499
- Isn't there a man on this...
- I've been training with Hank Aaron!

00:18:02.624 --> 00:18:04.960
You've been training with the Hank Aaron?

00:18:05.043 --> 00:18:06.795
I've been training with a Hank Aaron.

00:18:07.129 --> 00:18:09.339
All right, then. Get in there

00:18:09.423 --> 00:18:12.050
and pitch like you've never
pitched like you before!

00:18:13.594 --> 00:18:17.222
Now pitching for the Mets, Turanga Leela!

00:18:18.432 --> 00:18:20.976
Bean! Bean! Bean!

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:22.561
Yay, Leela!

00:18:24.479 --> 00:18:26.857
- Go, Leela!
- Put her right down the pike!

00:18:27.065 --> 00:18:30.152
Strike him out, Leela! Do it
for the hundreds of women everywhere!

00:18:30.319 --> 00:18:32.738
Bean! Bean! Bean!

00:18:32.821 --> 00:18:38.744
Your attention! Now pinch-hitting
for the Poindexters, Jackie Anderson.

00:18:41.038 --> 00:18:42.247
Will you look at that?

00:18:42.372 --> 00:18:44.917
College Blernsball's finest female hitter

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:48.712
making her big league debut against
pro ball's worst female anything?

00:18:49.004 --> 00:18:52.883
I've never seen anything this bizarre.
And I've seen Mr. Belvedere naked! Whoo!

00:18:54.092 --> 00:18:56.678
Keep cool.
She's just like any other player.

00:18:56.845 --> 00:18:59.181
She puts on her sports bra
one arm at a time.

00:19:03.977 --> 00:19:05.312
Strike one!

00:19:06.605 --> 00:19:09.733
Strike one! A personal best!

00:19:11.902 --> 00:19:14.363
Strike two!

00:19:17.282 --> 00:19:19.201
Remember, fans,
this exciting moment

00:19:19.326 --> 00:19:22.788
is brought to you by Month Old Franks,
the hotdogs with experience.

00:19:22.871 --> 00:19:23.872
Mmm, mmm.

00:20:09.459 --> 00:20:11.378
And grand slam blern!

00:20:11.503 --> 00:20:14.173
The Mets lose! Their season is over,

00:20:14.256 --> 00:20:18.427
and no question, Leela, the first
woman ever to reach the majors,

00:20:18.552 --> 00:20:22.806
will go down as the single worst player
in the history of Blernsball.

00:20:23.265 --> 00:20:27.102
She's taught the world
that being a bum knows no gender.

00:20:28.145 --> 00:20:31.773
And yet, tonight we have witnessed
the beginning of a great career

00:20:31.899 --> 00:20:35.986
for the first woman to play
the sport well. Jackie Anderson!

00:20:41.074 --> 00:20:42.868
- Leela?
- Jackie.

00:20:43.202 --> 00:20:47.289
I guess you were right.
I'm a lousy role model. I'm sorry.

00:20:47.539 --> 00:20:51.502
No, don't be. It turns out,
you were an inspiration after all.

00:20:52.336 --> 00:20:53.837
- I was?
- Uh-huh.

00:20:54.004 --> 00:20:56.256
I mean, you were so awful
that women everywhere

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:58.383
set out to prove
they don't stink as bad as you.

00:20:58.509 --> 00:21:00.010
You know, like a pig or somethin'.

00:21:00.177 --> 00:21:04.681
Oh. That's so kind of you.
I guess I made a difference after all.

00:21:05.098 --> 00:21:10.854
You absolutely did, Leela. Now, please.
Please retire? Immediately.

00:21:13.232 --> 00:21:15.609
Hey, kid? Catch.

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:28.914
Well, at least you're still the worst
football player of all time.

00:21:29.248 --> 00:21:30.415
Yeah.

00:21:31.041 --> 00:21:32.334
Yeah.